			"name": "Two-Handed Sword",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A Lychguard's warscythe is a two-handed power-field blade, wielded with real skill rather than a Warrior's blunt drilling.\n\nDesign: Two-Handed Sword (DX/A). DX+4 (16) for 16 points, Average.",
			"tags": [
				"Xenos",
