			"points": 16
		},
		{
			"id": "sFPLcPdTBr1RH03Bj",
			"name": "Shield",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A Lychguard equipped with a dispersion shield and hyperphase sword instead of a warscythe is drilled just as hard with it.\n\nDesign: Shield (DX/E). DX+2 (14) for 4 points, Easy.",
			"tags": [
				"Xenos",
